sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User/Browser
    participant Middleware as Next.js Middleware
    participant ServerComp as Server Component
    participant RouteHandler as Route Handler
    participant Express as Express Backend
    participant Redis as Redis Cache
    participant PG as PostgreSQL

    Note over User,PG: 1. LOGIN FLOW
    User->>RouteHandler: POST /api/auth/login
    RouteHandler->>Express: POST /auth/login + fingerprint
    Express->>PG: Validate credentials + rate limiting
    PG-->>Express: User found
    Express->>Express: Generate JWT (jti, aud, iss, fingerprint)
    Express->>Redis: Store session + refresh token (atomic)
    Express-->>RouteHandler: Access + Refresh tokens
    RouteHandler->>RouteHandler: Set httpOnly cookies
    RouteHandler-->>User: Redirect to /dashboard

    Note over User,PG: 2. PROTECTED PAGE SSR
    User->>Middleware: Navigate to /dashboard
    Middleware->>Middleware: Read accessToken from cookie
    Middleware->>Middleware: LOCAL: Verify JWT signature with jose
    Middleware->>Middleware: LOCAL: Check exp, iss, aud, claims
    alt Token valid & NOT expiring soon
        Middleware->>Middleware: Add x-user-id header
        Middleware->>ServerComp: Forward request
    else Token expires in <5min
        Note over Middleware,Express: ONLY NOW call backend
        Middleware->>Express: POST /auth/refresh
        Express->>Redis: Validate refresh token whitelist
        Express->>Redis: Rotate refresh token (atomic)
        Express-->>Middleware: New tokens
        Middleware->>Middleware: Update cookies in response
        Middleware->>ServerComp: Forward with new tokens
    else Token expired or invalid signature
        Note over Middleware,Express: Try refresh
        Middleware->>Express: POST /auth/refresh
        alt Refresh successful
            Express->>Redis: Validate + rotate
            Express-->>Middleware: New tokens
            Middleware->>ServerComp: Forward request
        else Refresh failed
            Middleware-->>User: Redirect to /login
        end
    end
    
    ServerComp->>ServerComp: cookies() - read accessToken
    ServerComp->>ServerComp: LOCAL: Verify JWT with jose
    ServerComp->>Express: Fetch data with token
    Express->>Express: Final validation (jti, fingerprint)
    Express->>Redis: Check blacklist + session
    Express-->>ServerComp: Protected data
    ServerComp-->>User: Render page

    Note over User,PG: 3. CLIENT API CALL (Token Expired)
    User->>ServerComp: Trigger action
    ServerComp->>Express: API request with cookie
    Express->>Express: Verify token + jti + fingerprint
    Express->>Redis: Check session
    Express-->>ServerComp: 401 Unauthorized
    ServerComp->>RouteHandler: POST /api/auth/refresh
    RouteHandler->>Express: Refresh with cookie
    Express->>Redis: Rotate token atomically
    Express-->>RouteHandler: New tokens
    RouteHandler->>RouteHandler: Update cookies
    RouteHandler-->>ServerComp: Success
    ServerComp->>Express: Retry original request
    Express-->>ServerComp: Success

    Note over User,PG: 4. LOGOUT
    User->>RouteHandler: POST /api/auth/logout
    RouteHandler->>Express: POST /auth/logout
    Express->>Redis: MULTI transaction
    Express->>Redis: Remove session + whitelist
    Express->>Redis: Add jti to blacklist (TTL)
    Express->>Redis: EXEC
    Express-->>RouteHandler: Success
    RouteHandler->>RouteHandler: Clear cookies
    RouteHandler-->>User: Redirect to /login
